## How the Style Guide Works

- The style guide is simply a page that displays components in isolation on a blank page.
- The style guide page is @page.style-guide.liquid.
- We primarily use two web components to build the style guide UI: `styleguide-ui`, which acts as a wrapper for `styleguide-section`.
- We need to add our components inside `styleguide-section`.